torial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p001:m0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"妳媼","kind":"person","person_id":"art_c8q_y8z","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"乳養婦稱，不當母氏","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p001","text":"桓玄，字敬道，一名靈寶，大司馬溫之孽子也。其母馬氏嘗與同輩夜坐，於月下見流星墜銅盆水中，忽如二寸火珠，冏然明淨，競以瓢接取，馬氏得而吞之，若有感，遂有娠。及生玄，有光照室，占者奇之，故小名靈寶。妳媼每抱詣溫，輒易人而後至，云其重兼常兒，溫甚愛異之。臨終，命以為嗣，襲爵南郡公。年七歲，溫服終，府州文武辭其叔父沖，沖撫玄頭曰：「此汝家之故吏也。」玄因涕淚覆面，眾並異之。及長，形貌瑰奇，風神疏朗，博綜藝術，善屬文。常負其才地，以雄豪自處，眾咸憚之，朝廷亦疑而未用。年二十三，始拜太子洗馬，時議謂溫有不臣之跡，故折玄兄弟而為素官。","source_position":{"kind":"wikitext_codepoint_positions","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-2644703-raw.wikitext","raw_start":213,"raw_end":478,"character_positions":[215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,244,245,246,247,248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284,285,286,287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301,302,303,304,305,306,307,308,309,310,311,312,313,314,315,316,317,318,319,320,321,322,323,324,325,326,327,328,329,330,331,332,333,334,335,336,337,338,339,340,341,342,343,344,345,346,347,348,349,350,351,352,353,354,355,356,357,358,359,360,361,362,363,364,365,366,367,368,369,370,371,372,373,374,375,376,377,378,379,380,381,382,383,384,385,386,387,388,389,390,391,392,393,394,395,396,397,398,399,400,401,402,403,404,405,406,407,408,409,410,411,412,413,414,415,416,417,418,419,420,421,422,423,424,425,426,427,428,429,43